  "title": "PepsiCo India nearly doubles electric truck fleet to 15, expands freight operations to three plants",
  "summary": "PepsiCo India has nearly doubled its electric freight truck fleet, now totaling 15 trucks across three locations. The company increased its annual electric freight distance to approximately 9 lakh kilometers since its launch. Alongside this initiative, PepsiCo India has electrified over 950 distributor-linked vehicles for last-mile transportation. Biomass currently makes up 97% of the company’s fuel mix in its operations.",
